<div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> TRANSPORT ENGINEER · DOCTORAL RESEARCHER</p><h1 id="hero-title">Understanding<br>what moves us<br><span class="accent-text">forward<span class="period">.</span></span></h1><p class="hero-intro">I’m <strong>Ahmed Almadhoun.</strong> I study how transport networks connect people, businesses and opportunity—and what happens when those connections fall short.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#research">Discover my work <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><a class="button button-quiet" href="#contact">Let’s connect <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-context"><span>Based in Warsaw, Poland</span><span>Warsaw University of Technology</span></div></div>
